      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.23 (up from ₹4.38 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹70.1b (up 11% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹5.47b (up 37% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.8% (up from 6.3% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 14% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 21% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
