      "date": "2026-02-10T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "CA Sardo Investments and Aditya Puri and his family agreed to acquire 45.03% stake in Nido Home Finance Limited from Edelweiss Financial Services Limited (NSEI:EDELWEISS), Edelweiss Rural & Corporate Services Limited and Edel Finance Company Limited for INR 6.03 billion.",
      "body": "CA Sardo Investments and Aditya Puri and his family agreed to acquire 45.03% stake in Nido Home Finance Limited from Edelweiss Financial Services Limited (NSEI:EDELWEISS), Edelweiss Rural & Corporate Services Limited and Edel Finance Company Limited for INR 6.03 billion on February 10, 2026. The buyers also will also be subscribing to equity shares and warrants of Nido. Upon completion of sale and allotment of equity shares and warrants by Nido as contemplated in the transaction, the Buyers will hold approximately 73% of the shareholding of Nido on a fully diluted basis.\r\n\r\nThe transaction is subject to approval by regulatory board / committee. The expected completion of the transaction is July 31, 2026.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "80",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
